\n## Image Upload and Posting\n\nImages and videos upload first via /rest/images and /rest/videos (chunked with ETag tracking), then the resulting URN is referenced in the post. The image must already exist as a valid LinkedIn image URN before creating the post.\n\n## Permissions\n\nFor sharing on LinkedIn from a personal profile, w_member_social allows posting, commenting and liking posts on behalf of an authenticated member. Adding the self-serve Share on LinkedIn product to a developer app and using the w_member_social scope lets the authenticated member publish immediately.\n\n## Required Headers\n\nAll APIs require the request header LinkedIn-Version in YYYYMM format and X-Restli-Protocol-Version: 2.0.0.\n\nThe official LinkedIn documentation for the Posts API is available on Microsoft's LinkedIn developer platform at learn.microsoft.com.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"aedb504f-d527-47cf-8934-f32e1f20589d","timestamp":"2026-10-03T08:53:01.732Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"LinkedIn Posts API /rest/posts images API w_member_social share on LinkedIn documentation","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01EhevMTXTUuoU2mG3SqcHTK","content":[{"title":"MultiImage API","url":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/linkedin/marketing/community-management/shares/multiimage-post-api?view=li-lms-2023-06"},{"title":"Teilen über","url":"https://learn.microsoft.com/de-ch/linkedin/marketing/community-management/shares/posts-api?view=li-lms-2024-07"},{"title":"LinkedIn API: Automate Company Page Posts","url":"https://www.postproxy.dev/blog/linkedin-api-automate-company-page-publishing/"},{"title":"Case StudyAugust 4, 202621 min readingMarcel Czuryszkiewicz","url":"https://bundle.social/blog/linkedin-api-post-profiles-company-pages"},{"title":"Unlimited Nano Banana 2 + 50% off your first month with code BIRTHDAY2026 Start free → Start free →","url":"https://www.blotato.com/blog/linkedin-posting-api"},{"